    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n329" root="اجن" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِئْجَنَةٌ</span></b>  [in Golius's Lex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِئْجَنٌ</span>] The <i>instrument
for beating used by the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَّار</span> [or <i>whitener of cloth,
in washing</i>]: but better without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>, [written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيجَنةٌ</span>,]
because the pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوَاجِنُ</span>; or, accord. to IB, the
pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآجِنُ</span>. (TA.)

